    {
     "level": "L0",
     "type": "sa",
     "marks": 3,
     "q": "The ages of boys in an after-school athletics squad are shown in the table below.<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9.5pt;color:#000;margin:1.2mm 0\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center;background:#eee;font-size:9pt\">Age</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center;background:#eee;font-size:9pt\">Frequency</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">10</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">3</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">11</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">8</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">12</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">12</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">13</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">14</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #000;padding:.2mm 2.4mm;text-align:center\">3</td></tr></table><b>a</b>&nbsp; State the total number of boys in the squad.<br><b>b</b>&nbsp; Calculate the mean age of the squad, correct to two decimal places.<br><b>c</b>&nbsp; What is the median age of the boys in the squad?",
     "sol": [
      "a $3 + 8 + 12 + 4 + 3 = 30$ boys",
      "b $\\dfrac{10 \\times 3 + 11 \\times 8 + 12 \\times 12 + 13 \\times 4 + 14 \\times 3}{30} = \\dfrac{356}{30} = 11.87$ years",
      "c The $15$th and $16$th ages are both $12$, so the median is $12$ years."
     ],
